    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/03bb409f6e81462cfb4e747e1c5c9505.avif?t=1721787151\" width=629 height=154 /></span><br>Tired of boring jump rope workouts? 'Sports Party' makes your fitness fun! This motion game replaces the jump rope with technology, making workouts enjoyable and easy. It's not only entertaining but also provides a comprehensive body workout. Since joining, I look forward to every workout. Give it a try, let 'Sports Party' introduce you to a new way of exercising, experience a new level of fitness, and make health a lifestyle choice!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/346d209c3b1099fdde13ac355a33bba9.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/346d209c3b1099fdde13ac355a33bba9.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/346d209c3b1099fdde13ac355a33bba9.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/bd53bf45e57fd6abf8cdef0f7a1a205e.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/bd53bf45e57fd6abf8cdef0f7a1a205e.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/bd53bf45e57fd6abf8cdef0f7a1a205e.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/331563b1cad36e45b8dca59d89c6e00a.avif?t=1721787151\" width=564 height=146 /></span><br>Does every workout feel like a chore? 'Sports Party' can turn that around. This motion fitness game turns the grind into a thrill, boosting your fitness and easing your body without even realizing it. It's not just about moving; it's about enjoying the process. You should give it a try\u2014I'm sure your body will thank you. Don't wait, let 'Sports Party' be your new workout buddy and enjoy every moment of a healthy life!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/abab669528ca50fc456dc8f8532c53f3.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/abab669528ca50fc456dc8f8532c53f3.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/abab669528ca50fc456dc8f8532c53f3.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/03bd72b36a26933224e948a8918d063f.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/03bd72b36a26933224e948a8918d063f.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/03bd72b36a26933224e948a8918d063f.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/ee0b9971ff054a8868f65c31e702d52a.avif?t=1721787151\" width=554 height=148 /></span><br>The game features 20 uniquely designed fitness levels, each with different exercises and challenge goals. Players must complete the specified moves within a time limit to score higher and earn rewards. As levels progress, the difficulty increases, testing players' coordination, speed, and stamina.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/eea5eab4311e4f7ebe18f4c7ad22c9fb.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/eea5eab4311e4f7ebe18f4c7ad22c9fb.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/eea5eab4311e4f7ebe18f4c7ad22c9fb.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/1216d9a42eb248b3d89b93ca4fe79011.avif?t=1721787151\" width=552 height=146 /></span><br>Sports Party supports online head-to-head with two players. You can invite friends to join fitness challenges, compete against each other, and improve together. The online competitive mode enhances interactivity and ignites the competitive spirit, making workouts more fun and intense.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/cface8a961f006c6e192f0a33ca86bfa.poster.avif?t=1721787151\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/cface8a961f006c6e192f0a33ca86bfa.webm?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067960/extras/cface8a961f006c6e192f0a33ca86bfa.mp4?t=1721787151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
